cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Academic Research Suite in your research, academic work, teaching, or scientific publications, please cite this software."
type: software

title: "Academic Research Suite"
short-title: "ARS"
version: "1.0.0"

abstract: >
  Academic Research Suite (ARS) is a collection of specialized AI-agent
  skills designed to support the academic research lifecycle, from
  literature discovery and research-gap identification to methodology
  design, academic writing, reference checking, journal selection, and
  pre-submission peer review.

